/target
.don
*.local.toml
web/node_modules
# The built bundle is a build artifact, not source. It's embedded into the
# binary and shipped in the published crate (Cargo.toml `include` puts it in
# the tarball regardless of this file), but it never belongs in git history.
# The directory itself is kept so a fresh clone compiles before npm has run.
web/dist/*
!web/dist/.gitkeep
